Align the CMP 170HX verifier grid to its 140 streaming multiprocessors.

The production geometry launches one partial CTA per KV head and segment.  With
four KV heads, NSEG=32 launches only 128 CTAs and leaves twelve of the 140 SMs
idle.  NSEG=35 launches exactly 140 CTAs, while NSEG=40/48/64 spill into a
second, poorly occupied wave.  Allow 35 and pad only the tiny final combine
reduction to Triton's next legal power-of-two arange.

The explicit-dequantization suite passed 895/896/897-token boundaries, mixed
requests, q=5/8/16/64, 65K context and a high physical block ID.  Interleaved
isolated tests improved 126K by 8.5% and 250K by 5.8%.  Repeated FULL-graph
model passes fell from 36.3 to 34.7-35.4 ms at 126K and from 50.0 to 47.5-48.1
ms at 250K; 4K stayed at 22.4 ms with zero preemptions.

Apply after spec-decode-segments-sm80.patch.

